                    &none       &none       &none       &none       &none           &none       &kp F9      &kp F10     &kp F11     &kp F12
                    &kp LGUI    &kp LSHFT   &kp LALT    &kp LCTRL   &none           &none       &kp F5      &kp F6      &kp F7      &kp F8
        &none       &none       &none       &none       &none       &none           &none       &kp F1      &kp F2      &kp F3      &kp F4    &none
